      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "After walking out on the Claude Monet kitchen, Chef Barinov is hiding in a dark storage room with a bottle. Ainura, the restaurant cleaner, stumbles upon his hiding place and catches him by surprise. Listen to their conversation in Russian first, then we will break down each line in English.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
