      "t": "Здравствуй, шеф.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Hello, Chef.' Ainura offers a simple, respectful greeting to her employer.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "ainura",
      "t": "Вот ты где прячешься!",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Here is where you are hiding!' Ainura finally discovers the boss in his dark hiding spot.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
