      "t": "Айнура, это ты?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Ainura, is that you?' Barinov asks to confirm who just walked into the room.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Не шуми, пожалуйста, так громко.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Do not make noise so loudly, please.' Barinov begs the cleaner to keep her voice down.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "ainura",
      "t": "Я долго искала тебя везде.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I looked for you everywhere for a long time.' Ainura explains she has been searching the entire building.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Садись рядом, выпьешь со мной?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Sit down next to me, want a drink with me?' Barinov invites her to sit and share a secret drink.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
